WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.520
We decided we would indeed
try and have a child,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.240
and then I had to get
my head around the idea

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.490
of having sex in order to conceive.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.303
Having sex with that being the reason,

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:13.300
(laughter)

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.263
'cause I've only ever had sex
for the fun reasons before,

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.320
like being drunk or revenge.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.570
(laughter)

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.684
(cheering)

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.100
But having sex in order to make a baby,

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.847
in my head I was like, "well
that's sounds something

00:00:31.847 --> 00:00:33.958
"that should be very, very serious!"

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:34.810
(laughter)

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:36.367
I said to my husband,
"There will be no fun

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:37.650
"involved in this.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.497
(laughter)

00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:40.057
"No talking dirty, that'll be like

00:00:40.057 --> 00:00:42.518
"bad parenting before
we've even become parents."

00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:44.210
(laughter)

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.400
I just build it up in my head,

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.350
I just imagined, sort of the whole act

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.980
to be something very, very solemn

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.730
that will be done in complete silence,

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.513
with your eyes closed.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.930
And the man will just be like,

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:58.271
(grunting)

00:00:58.271 --> 00:01:01.251
(laughter)

00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:02.084
(heavy breathing)

00:01:02.084 --> 00:01:04.334
(laughter)

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.641
It is done.

00:01:09.641 --> 00:01:11.891
(laughter)

00:01:13.971 --> 00:01:16.221
(cheering)

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.861
And then you shake hands

00:01:20.861 --> 00:01:22.190
(laughter)

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:25.514
and light a candle in memory
of your disposable income.

00:01:25.514 --> 00:01:26.347
(singing)

00:01:26.347 --> 00:01:28.597
(laughter)

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:32.560
Turns out though, in
reality, "making a baby" sex,

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.290
exactly the same as normal sex,

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:38.993
just with more existential dread
and a headstand at the end.

00:01:38.993 --> 00:01:41.243
(laughter)

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:47.018
And with my husband whispering
"swim, my little champions."

00:01:47.018 --> 00:01:49.711
(laughter)

00:01:49.711 --> 00:01:51.450
But his champions did
swim, or at least one

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.890
knackered old bastard
managed to get through,

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:54.723
and here we are.

00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:55.900
I'm at the stage now where I can feel

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.550
the baby moving inside me,

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.627
and I'll be honest, it's fucking weird.

00:02:00.627 --> 00:02:02.399
(laughter)

00:02:02.399 --> 00:02:03.500
I don't know if I like it.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.360
You're meant to love it, aren't you?

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.987
My husband says to me,
"does it feel magical?

00:02:06.987 --> 00:02:08.260
"Does it feel magical?"

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.387
I'm like, "well if by magical,

00:02:10.387 --> 00:02:13.034
"do you mean does it feel like
I've swallowed a live fish,

00:02:13.034 --> 00:02:16.007
(laughter)

00:02:16.007 --> 00:02:20.517
"that is freaking out inside
me, and headbutting my bladder,

00:02:20.517 --> 00:02:23.141
"then yes, it's a regular
fairy tale, darling!"

00:02:23.141 --> 00:02:24.980
(laughter)

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.220
Does feel very odd, it does,

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.710
but I've gotta get used to this now,

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:31.110
'cause I'm over half way, which
means in just a few months,

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:33.790
I will finally be able to cradle

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.752
a wine.

00:02:37.752 --> 00:02:39.386
(laughter)

00:02:39.386 --> 00:02:41.636
(cheering)

00:02:46.622 --> 00:02:48.280
I can't stop thinking about it!

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.113
(laughter)

00:02:49.113 --> 00:02:51.573
I'm like "oh my god,
what will it look like?

00:02:51.573 --> 00:02:53.367
(laughter)

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:54.885
"How big will it be?

00:02:54.885 --> 00:02:56.067
(laughter)

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:58.267
"Will I be able to cope
with more than one?"

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:03.020
I am finding the no
drinking thing quite hard,

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.210
which I wasn't expecting,

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.700
'cause all my friends who've had children,

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.737
said "you don't miss alcohol
when you're pregnant,

00:03:07.737 --> 00:03:08.960
"don't miss alcohol at all!"

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.653
I can confirm, that is absolute bullshit!

00:03:11.653 --> 00:03:12.610
(laughter)

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.190
People ask me if I have cravings.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:17.472
Yeah, two quite strong ones,
pinot and grigio, thank you!

00:03:17.472 --> 00:03:19.722
(laughter)

